  "details": "The maintenance notice is terrible to read with a screen reader software, I love hearing \"underscore underscore, underscore underscore underscore backwards slash backwards slash forward slash forward slash\" with screen reader software five times before getting to the actual message that the website is under maintenance and will be back soon.\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n\n1. Visit https://wiki.vrchat.com/ during a maintenance.\n\n2. Using Microsoft Edge as an example, press Ctrl + Shift + U for Read aloud.\n\n# ASCII logo\n\nThe following ASCII art logo is presentational and should be assisted to be read out as \"VRChat\".\n\nActual original markup (lines 12-17):\n\n```\n\n            <div class=\"ascii-logo-large\">\n\n              <p class=\"p l\"> __   _____  ___ _  _   _ _____ </p>\n\n              <p class=\"p l\"> \\ \\ / / _ \\/ __| || | /_\\_   _|</p>\n\n              <p class=\"p l\">  \\ V /|   / (__| __ |/ _ \\| |  </p>\n\n              <p class=\"p l\">   \\_/ |_|_\\\\___|_||_/_/ \\_\\_|  </p>\n\n            </div>\n\n```\n\nExpected markup for accessibility (minimum viable solution):\n\n```\n\n            <div class=\"ascii-logo-large\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"VRChat\">\n\n              <p class=\"p l\" aria-hidden=\"true\"> __   _____  ___ _  _   _ _____ </p>\n\n              <p class=\"p l\" aria-hidden=\"true\"> \\ \\ / / _ \\/ __| || | /_\\_   _|</p>\n\n              <p class=\"p l\" aria-hidden=\"true\">  \\ V /|   / (__| __ |/ _ \\| |  </p>\n\n              <p class=\"p l\" aria-hidden=\"true\">   \\_/ |_|_\\\\___|_||_/_/ \\_\\_|  </p>\n\n            </div>\n\n```\n\nOr even better, rewrite it to use a `<pre>` element with an additional CSS edit:\n\n```\n\n          <div class=\"ascii-logo-large\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"VRChat\">\n\n            <pre class=\"pre l\" aria-hidden=\"true\"> __   _____  ___ _  _   _ _____ \n\n \\ \\ / / _ \\/ __| || | /_\\_   _|\n\n  \\ V /|   / (__| __ |/ _ \\| |  \n\n   \\_/ |_|_\\\\___|_||_/_/ \\_\\_|  </pre>\n\n          </div>\n\n```\n\nIn https://assets.vrchat.com/www/css/under-maintainence-page.css (sic), add:\n\n```\n\n.t .system-boot .pre {\n\n    color: #fff;\n\n}\n\n```\n\nI hereby release the above proposed changes into the public domain. This applies worldwide. If this is not legally possible: I grant any entity the right to use this work for any purpose, without any conditions, unless such conditions are required by law.\n\nVideo demonstrations have been attached in the comments of this topic.",
